## Code Quality Analysis Organization

### Roslynator/Analyzer Workspace Structure
```
Workspaces/CodeQuality/
├── README.md                         # Comprehensive usage documentation
├── run-analyzer.{ps1|sh}            # Automated analysis execution script
├── CONFIGURATION_COMPLETE.md        # Setup completion status
└── Analyzer/
    ├── Config/
    │   └── analyzer.config          # Main analyzer configuration
    ├── Reports/
    │   ├── baseline-analysis.json   # Initial baseline for comparison
    │   ├── latest-analysis.json     # Most recent analysis
    │   └── analysis_*.json          # Timestamped historical reports
    └── Logs/
        ├── latest-analysis.log      # Most recent execution log
        └── analysis_*.log           # Timestamped historical logs
```

### Documentation Location
```
Workspaces/Documentation/CODE_QUALITY/
├── latest-analysis-documentation.md    # Most recent analysis documentation
└── analysis-documentation_*.md         # Timestamped historical documentation
```

