## Instructions for Agents

### On Task Execution (task.prompt.md)
- **Before Implementation:** Run linter to establish baseline
- **After Implementation:** Validate with full build and linter
- **Commit Requirement:** All code quality checks must pass

### On Refactor (refactor.prompt.md)
- **Initial Analysis:** Run {{PLACEHOLDER_ANALYZER_COMMAND}} for baseline
- **During Refactor:** Fix analyzer violations incrementally
- **Final Validation:** Zero errors, zero warnings required
- **Documentation:** Update this file if analyzer configuration changes

### On Sync (sync.prompt.md)
- **Update This File:** Reflect REAL current state of analyzers
- **Remove Obsolete:** Delete outdated analyzer references
- **Add New:** Document newly introduced analyzers
- **Verify Paths:** Ensure all configuration paths are correct

### On Healthcheck (healthcheck.prompt.md)
- **Analyzer Validation:** Verify all quality tools are configured
- **Baseline Check:** Compare current state vs. baseline
- **Report Issues:** Document any analyzer configuration problems

